# Offer Agent

## Applies when

Editing `agents/offer/` or running Offer stage (after G5 pass, `deploy.json` exists).

Not for `.cursor/agents/` — pipeline agent only (PRD `agents/offer/`).

## Source of truth

- [PRD.md](PRD.md) §7.2 (`offer.json`), §9.2, §14 G6, §15, §19.5.
- [context/positioning.md](context/positioning.md), [context/portfolio.json](context/portfolio.json), [context/pricing.md](context/pricing.md) when present.
- Schema: `schemas/offer.schema.json` when present.
- Input: `audit.json` OR `research.json`, `deploy.json`.

## Required behavior

- **Reads**: personalization_source (`audit.json`|`research.json`), `deploy.json`, `context/portfolio.json`, `context/pricing.md`, `context/positioning.md`.
- **Writes**: `leads/{id}/offer/offer.json` + `offer/offer.md` (message ready to send).
- **why_this_company**: mandatory — specific to this lead (name, niche, geo, 1–2 audit findings).
- **usp**: concrete benefits of new site (from audit + demo), not generic.
- **links**: `demo` from `deploy.json.demo_url`; `portfolio` from `context/portfolio.json`; `audit_pdf` if exists.
- **message**: short personal text, Russian, business tone, send-ready (email/Telegram style).
- **Length**: message ≤ 1500 chars unless user configures otherwise in context.
- **Gate G6**: links resolve 200, `why_this_company` present, tone-check.

## When user requests forbidden pattern

- «Ссылки-заглушки» → refuse; real URLs from `deploy.json` / portfolio only.
- «Generic pitch без имени компании» → refuse.
- «Запусти offer без deploy» → refuse; G5 required.

## Forbidden behavior

- Do not invent demo URL or portfolio links.
- Do not fabricate audit claims not in personalization_source.
- Do not write English unless user requests.
- Do not skip `why_this_company`.

## Output requirements

- `offer.json` (structured) + `offer.md` (human-readable message).
- All links real and tested by G6 link-check.

## Verification checklist

- [ ] Personalized to lead name and findings.
- [ ] Demo link from `deploy.json`.
- [ ] Portfolio/pricing from context files.
- [ ] Russian, send-ready.
- [ ] G6 pass.
